    {
      "id": "dp-cover",
      "title": "動感詩歌",
      "notes": "開場。介紹今天的課題：用詩歌學節奏，再為詩歌配上聲響。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-cover\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cover dp-scene\" data-slide-id=\"dp-cover\" aria-label=\"動感詩歌\"><div class=\"dp-art-pair\"><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐘\"><img src=\"./images/elephant-savanna.png\" alt=\"友善的大象在草地上\"></div><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐸\"><img src=\"./images/frog-pond-rain.png\" alt=\"青蛙背着小鼓站在荷葉上\"></div></div><div class=\"dp-copy\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">P2 音樂</p><h1>動感詩歌</h1><p class=\"dp-lead\">詩歌的節奏・為詩歌配聲響</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-two-rhythms-q",
      "title": "同一句話，兩種節奏",
      "notes": "6–13 分鐘。教師用兩種節奏讀「大笨象」：A＝大(長) 笨象(短短)；B＝大笨(短短) 象(長)，邊讀邊拍拍子。\n問：兩次讀法有甚麼不同？\n預期答案：第一次「大」讀得長；第二次「象」讀得長。\n觀察：學生能否跟讀及說出哪個字較長。此頁不顯示答案。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-two-rhythms-q\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"dp-two-rhythms-q\" aria-label=\"同一句話，兩種節奏\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">聽一聽，讀一讀</p><h2>同一句話，兩種節奏</h2><div class=\"dp-ab\"><div class=\"dp-ab-row\"><span class=\"dp-ab-tag\">A</span><span class=\"dp-big-words\">大笨象</span></div><div class=\"dp-ab-row\"><span class=\"dp-ab-tag\">B</span><span class=\"dp-big-words\">大笨象</span></div></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-two-rhythms-a",
      "title": "大笨象：A 與 B",
      "notes": "6–13 分鐘。逐一讀 A 和 B，學生跟讀並拍拍子。\n問：哪個字讀得較長？哪兩個字接得較緊密？\n預期答案：A「大」較長，「笨象」接得緊密；B「象」較長，「大笨」接得緊密。\n按「標出長字」後，長字放大並變為紅色，用來核對答案。\n觀察：學生能否用「長」「短」「緊密」描述。\n譜面修訂：原四分音符後接一拍休止，改為二分音符，該字連續維持兩拍，不在第二拍停聲。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-two-rhythms-a\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"dp-two-rhythms-a\" aria-label=\"大笨象 A 與 B\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>哪個字讀得較長？<br><span class=\"dp-sub\">哪兩個字接得較緊密？</span></h2><div class=\"dp-ab\"><div class=\"dp-ab-row\"><span class=\"dp-ab-tag\">A</span><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta dp-long\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>大</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>笨象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-ab-row\"><span class=\"dp-ab-tag\">B</span><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>大笨</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half dp-long\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>象</b></span></div></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"reveal-long\">標出長字</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "reveal-long",
          "label": "標出長字（再按收回）"
        }
      ]
