    {
      "id": "dp-key-idea",
      "title": "文字與節奏",
      "notes": "6–13 分鐘。總結：同一句話可以有不同節奏。\n問：節奏幫我們決定甚麼？\n預期答案：字何時出現、讀多久、在哪裏停。\n觀察：學生能否用自己的話複述。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-key-idea\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"dp-key-idea\" aria-label=\"文字與節奏\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>同一句話，可以有不同節奏</h2><div class=\"dp-concept\"><div class=\"dp-concept-source\"><strong>文字</strong><span>大　笨　象</span><small>說的是甚麼？</small></div><span class=\"dp-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><div class=\"dp-concept-result\"><strong>節奏</strong><div class=\"dp-timeline\"><span class=\"dp-duration long\">大</span><span class=\"dp-duration\">笨</span><span class=\"dp-duration\">象</span><span class=\"dp-pause\">停</span></div><div class=\"dp-timeline\"><span class=\"dp-duration\">大</span><span class=\"dp-duration\">笨</span><span class=\"dp-duration long\">象</span><span class=\"dp-pause\">停</span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-concept-labels\"><span>起點 → 何時出現</span><span>長短 → 讀多久</span><span>空位 → 在哪裏停</span></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-elephant-poem",
      "title": "《大笨象》朗讀 1/3",
      "notes": "教師先示範，再讓學生按節奏朗讀本頁詩句（版本一）。\n大笨象，鼻子長，\n象牙彎，像月亮，\n二分音符讀足兩拍；休止符停聲。每頁最多兩句，先慢讀，再保持穩定拍子。\n聆聽問題可由教師按鈕揭示／收起。\n音符及節奏讀法預設隱藏，歌詞保留。教師可分別按「顯示／收起第1句節奏」及第2句按鈕揭示。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-elephant-poem\" class=\"dp-slide dp-scene dp-reading-page\" data-slide-id=\"dp-elephant-poem\" aria-label=\"大笨象分句朗讀\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>《大笨象》<span class=\"dp-sub\">朗讀 1 / 3</span></h2><div class=\"dp-reading-phrase\" data-reading-phrase=\"1\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>大</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>笨象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>鼻</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>子長</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-reading-phrase\" data-reading-phrase=\"2\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>牙彎</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>像</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>月亮</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐘\"><img src=\"./images/elephant-savanna.png\" alt=\"大象的長鼻、象牙與大耳朵\"></div><aside class=\"dp-listen-question\"><strong>聽一聽</strong><p>每句開頭三個字，哪個字最長？</p><span>版本一 ／ 版本二</span></aside><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-question\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-rhythm-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-rhythm-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
