    {
      "id": "dp-elephant-poem-3",
      "title": "《大笨象》朗讀 3/3",
      "notes": "教師先示範，再讓學生按節奏朗讀本頁詩句（版本一）。\n一扇一扇好清涼。\n二分音符讀足兩拍；休止符停聲。每頁最多兩句，先慢讀，再保持穩定拍子。\n音符及節奏讀法預設隱藏，歌詞保留。教師可分別按「顯示／收起第1句節奏」及第2句按鈕揭示。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-elephant-poem-3\" class=\"dp-slide dp-scene dp-reading-page\" data-slide-id=\"dp-elephant-poem-3\" aria-label=\"大笨象分句朗讀\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>《大笨象》<span class=\"dp-sub\">朗讀 3 / 3</span></h2><div class=\"dp-reading-phrase\" data-reading-phrase=\"1\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>好清</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>涼</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐘\"><img src=\"./images/elephant-savanna.png\" alt=\"大象的長鼻、象牙與大耳朵\"></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-rhythm-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
