    {
      "id": "dp-elephant-compare",
      "title": "《大笨象》兩個版本",
      "notes": "兩個版本起初均隱藏。用教師按鈕分別揭示左側版本一、右側版本二。兩邊均顯示全首五句及相同的符號／讀法／文字結構。\n版本一前三句：長—短短；版本二前三句：短短—長。第4、5句相同。\n先拍拍子再讀，休止符停下。\n譜面修訂：原四分音符後接一拍休止，改為二分音符，該字連續維持兩拍，不在第二拍停聲。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-elephant-compare\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream dp-comparison\" data-slide-id=\"dp-elephant-compare\" aria-label=\"大笨象兩個版本\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>《大笨象》：比較兩種節奏</h2><div class=\"dp-version-grid\"><article class=\"dp-version dp-version-1\"><h3>版本一</h3><div class=\"dp-version-content\"><div class=\"dp-lines\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>大</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>笨象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>鼻</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>子長</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>牙彎</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>像</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>月亮</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>四</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>條腿</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>似</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>棟樑</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>兩耳</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>圓圓</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>像</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>把扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>好清</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>涼</b></span></div></div></div></article><article class=\"dp-version dp-version-2\"><h3>版本二</h3><div class=\"dp-version-content\"><div class=\"dp-lines\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>大笨</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>鼻子</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>長</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>象牙</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>彎</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>像月</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>亮</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>四條</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>腿</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>似棟</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>樑</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>兩耳</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>圓圓</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>像</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>把扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>好清</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>涼</b></span></div></div></div></article></div></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-v1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-v2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></section>",
