    {
      "id": "dp-ending-long",
      "title": "句末的長字",
      "notes": "13–28 分鐘。全班讀最後一句。\n問：一扇一扇好清涼——哪個字最長？\n預期答案：「涼」最長。\n按「揭示答案」：「涼」放大，並顯示「句末用較長的節奏收結」。\n觀察：學生能否指出句末字較長。\n譜面修訂：原四分音符後接一拍休止，改為二分音符，該字連續維持兩拍，不在第二拍停聲。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-ending-long\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"dp-ending-long\" aria-label=\"句末的長字\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>哪個字最長？</h2><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>好清</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half dp-long\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>涼</b></span></div><p class=\"dp-answer\">句末用較長的節奏收結</p><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"reveal-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "reveal-end",
          "label": "揭示「涼」（再按收回）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-rhythm-cards",
      "title": "節奏卡",
      "notes": "13–28 分鐘。參照《Unit 2 Book》第17頁，投影顯示十組完整詩詞及三種節奏型。\n請學生先讀詩詞，再用現有標記畫筆或 Pointer 將左右文字連至中央節奏卡。留白區供連線；沒有預設唯一答案。三字詞可配 ta ti-ti 或 ti-ti ta，四字詞可配 ti-ti ti-ti。請學生按自己的讀法解釋，觀察字數、起音與節奏是否配合。\n「好清涼」在句末，可選較長節奏收結，不強迫配到只有兩拍的三張卡。此頁不更改其他朗讀頁的節奏版本。\n左欄：大笨象、鼻子長、象牙彎、像月亮、四條腿、似棟樑。\n右欄：兩耳圓圓、像把扇、一扇一扇、好清涼。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-rhythm-cards\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sky dp-book-match\" data-slide-id=\"dp-rhythm-cards\" aria-label=\"大笨象文字與節奏配對\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>《大笨象》文字與節奏</h2><p class=\"dp-match-instruction\">讀一讀，把文字跟合適的節奏連起來。</p><div class=\"dp-match-board\"><div class=\"dp-match-words dp-match-left\"><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>大笨象</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>鼻子長</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>象牙彎</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>像月亮</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>四條腿</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>似棟樑</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div><div class=\"dp-cards\"><div class=\"dp-card\"><span class=\"dp-card-no\">1</span><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-card\"><span class=\"dp-card-no\">2</span><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-card\"><span class=\"dp-card-no\">3</span><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-match-words dp-match-right\"><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>兩耳圓圓</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>像把扇</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>一扇一扇</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-match-word\"><span>好清涼</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div></div></div><p class=\"dp-match-ending\">「好清涼」在句末，可用較長的節奏收結。</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-beat-rhythm",
      "title": "拍子與節奏",
      "notes": "28–35 分鐘。學生站立：腳踏穩定拍子（拍子 beat），手拍文字節奏（節奏 rhythm），口讀「大笨象，鼻子長」。先分開做，再合起來。\n問：腳和手做的事有甚麼不同？\n預期答案：腳一直平均地踏；手跟着字的長短拍。\n觀察：學生踏步是否穩定，手是否跟字的長短。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-beat-rhythm\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream dp-scene dp-beat-scene\" data-slide-id=\"dp-beat-rhythm\" aria-label=\"拍子與節奏\"><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"👣\"><img src=\"./images/children-beat.png\" alt=\"三位小學生：一位踏步、一位拍手、一位朗讀\"></div><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>腳＝心跳，手＝文字</h2><div class=\"dp-grid6\"><p class=\"dp-row-label\">腳 · 拍子 beat</p><div class=\"dp-beat-row\" aria-label=\"穩定的拍子\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p class=\"dp-row-label\">手 · 節奏 rhythm</p><div class=\"dp-line dp-line6\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>大</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>笨象</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>鼻</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>子長</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-whole-beat",
      "title": "《大笨象》全首拍子與節奏",
      "notes": "全首採用第8頁的版本二節奏。每個圓點一拍（包括休止符）；上方圓點是穩定拍子，下方是節奏與詩句。\n按播放：先4拍預備，連同拍子聲，再以72 BPM逐拍變色及發聲。播放完自動停止；可隨時停止或重設。\n聲音由投影電腦播放。如瀏覽器阻擋，請在投影電腦按「啟用拍子聲」一次，再從教師控制器播放。\n譜面修訂：原四分音符後接一拍休止，改為二分音符，該字連續維持兩拍，不在第二拍停聲。\n「涼」的二分音符在兩拍內維持高亮；上方拍子圓點和拍子聲仍每拍一次。",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "beat-play",
          "label": "播放（4拍預備）"
        },
        {
          "id": "beat-stop",
          "label": "停止"
        },
        {
          "id": "beat-reset",
          "label": "重設"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-whole-beat\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream dp-whole-beat\" data-slide-id=\"dp-whole-beat\" aria-label=\"全首拍子與節奏\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><header><h2>《大笨象》</h2><span>版本二 · 上：拍子 · 下：節奏與詩句</span><p class=\"dp-follow-status\" role=\"status\">準備：4 拍</p></header><div class=\"dp-preparation\" aria-label=\"四拍預備\"><i>1</i><i>2</i><i>3</i><i>4</i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-row\" style=\"--beats:6\"><div class=\"dp-follow-beats\"><i data-beat=\"0\" aria-label=\"第1拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"1\" aria-label=\"第2拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"2\" aria-label=\"第3拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"3\" aria-label=\"第4拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"4\" aria-label=\"第5拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"5\" aria-label=\"第6拍\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-rhythm\"><div data-rhythm-beat=\"0\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>大笨</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"1\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>象</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"3\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>鼻子</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"4\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>長</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-follow-row\" style=\"--beats:6\"><div class=\"dp-follow-beats\"><i data-beat=\"6\" aria-label=\"第7拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"7\" aria-label=\"第8拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"8\" aria-label=\"第9拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"9\" aria-label=\"第10拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"10\" aria-label=\"第11拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"11\" aria-label=\"第12拍\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-rhythm\"><div data-rhythm-beat=\"6\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>象牙</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"7\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>彎</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"9\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>像月</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"10\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>亮</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-follow-row\" style=\"--beats:6\"><div class=\"dp-follow-beats\"><i data-beat=\"12\" aria-label=\"第13拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"13\" aria-label=\"第14拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"14\" aria-label=\"第15拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"15\" aria-label=\"第16拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"16\" aria-label=\"第17拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"17\" aria-label=\"第18拍\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-rhythm\"><div data-rhythm-beat=\"12\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>四條</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"13\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>腿</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"15\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>似棟</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"16\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>樑</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-follow-row\" style=\"--beats:5\"><div class=\"dp-follow-beats\"><i data-beat=\"18\" aria-label=\"第19拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"19\" aria-label=\"第20拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"20\" aria-label=\"第21拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"21\" aria-label=\"第22拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"22\" aria-label=\"第23拍\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-rhythm\"><div data-rhythm-beat=\"18\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>兩耳</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"19\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>圓圓</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"20\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>像</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"21\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>把扇</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"22\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-rest\" data-r=\"rest\"><img src=\"./symbols/rest.svg\" alt=\"𝄽\"><small>—</small><b>&nbsp;</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"dp-follow-row\" style=\"--beats:5\"><div class=\"dp-follow-beats\"><i data-beat=\"23\" aria-label=\"第24拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"24\" aria-label=\"第25拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"25\" aria-label=\"第26拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"26\" aria-label=\"第27拍\"></i><i data-beat=\"27\" aria-label=\"第28拍\"></i></div><div class=\"dp-follow-rhythm\"><div data-rhythm-beat=\"23\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"24\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>一扇</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"25\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>好清</b></span></div><div data-rhythm-beat=\"26\" data-beats=\"2\" style=\"grid-column:span 2\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>涼</b></span></div></div></div></div><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"beat-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"beat-stop\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" hidden data-action=\"beat-reset\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-enable-beat\" data-enable-beat hidden>啟用拍子聲</button></section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-frog-poem",
      "title": "《青蛙打鼓》",
      "notes": "35–44 分鐘。教師示範讀全首，學生跟讀，再一邊拍節奏一邊讀。二分音符持續兩拍。\n問：哪一句最長？哪些字讀得特別慢？\n預期答案：「快快敲，慢慢敲」一句；「慢慢敲」的字讀得較長。\n觀察：學生能否保持拍子穩定。\n譜面修訂：原四分音符後接一拍休止，改為二分音符，該字連續維持兩拍，不在第二拍停聲。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-frog-poem\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream dp-rhythm-page\" data-slide-id=\"dp-frog-poem\" aria-label=\"青蛙打鼓\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>《青蛙打鼓》</h2><div class=\"dp-lines\"><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>風來</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>了</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>雨來</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>了</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>青蛙</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>背着</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>鼓來</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>了</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>快快</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>敲</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>慢</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>慢</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>敲</b></span></div><div class=\"dp-line\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>又唱</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>又跳</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>把</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>身</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>搖</b></span></div></div><p class=\"dp-note\">二分音符：讀足兩拍</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-fast-slow",
      "title": "快快敲，慢慢敲",
      "notes": "35–44 分鐘。腳踏拍子，讀「快快敲」與「慢慢敲」。\n重點：拍子速度不變，只是字的長短不同。「快快」兩個字放在一拍內（短），「慢慢」每個字一拍（長）。\n問：「快快」和「慢慢」各用了幾拍？\n預期答案：「快快」一拍；「慢慢」兩拍。\n觀察：學生讀「慢慢」時腳步不放慢。\n上排「快快」為兩個八分音符（共一拍），「敲」為二分音符（兩拍），全句三拍。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-fast-slow\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"dp-fast-slow\" aria-label=\"快快敲，慢慢敲\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>字的長短不同</h2><div class=\"dp-fs\"><div class=\"dp-fs-row\"><p class=\"dp-fs-label\">快快敲</p><div class=\"dp-line dp-line-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-titi\" data-r=\"titi\"><img src=\"./symbols/titi.svg\" alt=\"♫\"><small>ti-ti</small><b>快快</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-half\" data-r=\"half\"><img src=\"./symbols/half.svg\" alt=\"二分音符（兩拍）\"><small>ta-a</small><b>敲</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-fs-row\"><p class=\"dp-fs-label\">慢慢敲</p><div class=\"dp-line dp-line-grid\"><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>慢</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>慢</b></span><span class=\"dp-cell dp-ta\" data-r=\"ta\"><img src=\"./symbols/ta.svg\" alt=\"♩\"><small>ta</small><b>敲</b></span></div></div><div class=\"dp-fs-row\"><p class=\"dp-fs-label\">拍子</p><div class=\"dp-beat-row dp-beat-row3\" aria-label=\"三個平均的拍子\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div><p class=\"dp-steady\">拍子速度不變</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-sounds-q",
      "title": "詩歌裏的聲音",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。學生閉上眼睛想像池塘的情景。\n問：《青蛙打鼓》裏會出現甚麼聲音？\n預期答案：風聲、雨聲、青蛙叫聲、鼓聲等。\n觀察：學生能否從詩句找出聲音。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-sounds-q\" class=\"dp-slide dp-poem dp-scene\" data-slide-id=\"dp-sounds-q\" aria-label=\"詩歌裏的聲音\"><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐸\"><img src=\"./images/frog-pond-rain.png\" alt=\"青蛙背着小鼓站在荷葉上，有風和小雨\"></div><div class=\"dp-copy\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">想一想</p><h2>詩歌裏會出現<br>甚麼聲音？</h2></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-sounds-a",
      "title": "六種聲音",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。學生先說，再按「下一個聲音」逐一出現核對（全部出現後再按會收起）。\n可追問：哪個聲音在詩句中出現？例如「又唱」→青蛙的歌聲。\n觀察：學生能否把聲音和詩句配對。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-sounds-a\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"dp-sounds-a\" aria-label=\"六種聲音\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>詩歌裏的聲音</h2><ol class=\"dp-sounds\"><li class=\"dp-step\">風聲</li><li class=\"dp-step\">雨聲</li><li class=\"dp-step\">青蛙叫聲</li><li class=\"dp-step\">快慢不同的鼓聲</li><li class=\"dp-step\">青蛙的歌聲</li><li class=\"dp-step\">搖動身體的聲音</li></ol><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"reveal-sounds\">下一個聲音</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "reveal-sounds",
          "label": "下一個聲音"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-rain-vote",
      "title": "哪一個最像雨聲？",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。學生閉上眼睛。教師在樂器後面依次奏 A 沙槌、B 小鼓、C 三角鐵。\n投票：學生閉眼舉手，用手指 1／2／3 表示選 A／B／C。\n按「揭示樂器」顯示 A 沙槌、B 小鼓、C 三角鐵。\n追問：為甚麼你覺得像雨聲？（引導用「沙沙」「清脆」等詞語）\n觀察：學生能否說出理由。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-rain-vote\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"dp-rain-vote\" aria-label=\"哪一個最像雨聲\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">閉上眼睛聽</p><h2>哪一個最像雨聲？</h2><div class=\"dp-vote\"><div class=\"dp-vote-card\"><span class=\"dp-vote-letter\">A</span><span class=\"dp-vote-name\">沙槌</span></div><div class=\"dp-vote-card\"><span class=\"dp-vote-letter\">B</span><span class=\"dp-vote-name\">小鼓</span></div><div class=\"dp-vote-card\"><span class=\"dp-vote-letter\">C</span><span class=\"dp-vote-name\">三角鐵</span></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"reveal-rain\">揭示樂器</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "reveal-rain",
          "label": "揭示樂器（再按收回）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-scrape",
      "title": "刮瓜：短刮與長刮",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。教師示範刮瓜「短刮」及「長刮」。\n問：哪一個像青蛙叫？哪一個像青蛙唱歌？\n預期答案：短刮像青蛙叫，長刮像青蛙唱歌。\n按「揭示」顯示「叫聲短，歌聲較長」。\n觀察：學生能否用長短描述聲音。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-scrape\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"dp-scrape\" aria-label=\"刮瓜短刮與長刮\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">刮瓜</p><div class=\"dp-compare\"><div class=\"dp-compare-card\"><span class=\"dp-scrape dp-scrape-short\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3>短刮</h3></div><div class=\"dp-compare-card\"><span class=\"dp-scrape dp-scrape-long\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3>長刮</h3></div></div><p class=\"dp-question\">哪一個像青蛙叫？<br>哪一個像青蛙唱歌？</p><p class=\"dp-answer\">叫聲短，歌聲較長</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"reveal-scrape\">揭示</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "reveal-scrape",
          "label": "揭示（再按收回）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-sound-words",
      "title": "聲音特質詞語",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。學生用詞語牆及句式說明選擇。\n例子：「我選沙槌，因為沙沙聲像雨聲。」\n觀察：學生能否用聲音特質詞語說明理由。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-sound-words\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"dp-sound-words\" aria-label=\"聲音特質詞語\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>聲音像甚麼？</h2><div class=\"dp-word-wall\"><span>沙沙</span><span>清脆</span><span>低沉</span><span>長</span><span>短</span><span>輕</span><span>重</span></div><p class=\"dp-frame\">我選＿＿，因為＿＿聲像＿＿。</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-groups",
      "title": "分組配聲",
      "notes": "44–52 分鐘。分組，每組負責一句，從兩個選項中選一種聲音。給每組 1–2 分鐘試奏。\n選項可在 deck.json 此頁的表格修改。\n觀察：各組能否按詩句選擇合適的聲音並說出理由。\n各組先看圖確認樂器，再按老師指示領取；表格中的「／」是二選一。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-groups\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"dp-groups\" aria-label=\"分組配聲\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>分組配聲</h2><table class=\"dp-table\"><thead><tr><th>組別</th><th>詩句</th><th>選擇所需聲響／樂器</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g1\">第一組</span></td><td>風來了</td><td>人聲「呼呼」／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/maracas.svg\" alt=\"沙槌\"><span>沙槌</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g2\">第二組</span></td><td>雨來了</td><td><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/maracas.svg\" alt=\"沙槌\"><span>沙槌</span></span>／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/triangle.svg\" alt=\"三角鐵\"><span>三角鐵</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g3\">第三組</span></td><td>青蛙背着鼓來了、又唱又跳</td><td><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/guiro.svg\" alt=\"刮瓜\"><span>刮瓜</span></span>／人聲</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g4\">第四組</span></td><td>快快敲，慢慢敲</td><td><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/drum.svg\" alt=\"小鼓\"><span>小鼓</span></span>／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/hand-drum.svg\" alt=\"手鼓\"><span>手鼓</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-gt\">老師/ 其他學生</span></td><td>把身搖</td><td><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/triangle.svg\" alt=\"三角鐵\"><span>三角鐵</span></span>或<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/xylophone.svg\" alt=\"木琴\"><span>木琴</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-signals",
      "title": "手勢指示",
      "notes": "52–59 分鐘。練習手勢：舉手＝預備（拿起樂器）；指向組別＝該組開始；握拳＝全部停止。\n先用手勢玩「預備—開始—停止」兩三次，再開始合奏。\n觀察：學生能否看手勢即時開始及停止。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-signals\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sky\" data-slide-id=\"dp-signals\" aria-label=\"手勢指示\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>看手勢</h2><div class=\"dp-signals\"><div><span class=\"dp-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✋</span><h3>舉手</h3><p>預備</p></div><div><span class=\"dp-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">👉</span><h3>指向組別</h3><p>開始</p></div><div><span class=\"dp-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✊</span><h3>握拳</h3><p>停止</p></div></div></div></section>",
      "media": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-ensemble",
      "title": "合奏《青蛙打鼓》",
      "notes": "52–59 分鐘。全班朗讀，各組按手勢在自己的詩句加入聲響。\n按「下一句」逐句高亮輪到的組別；最後一句之後再按會重設。\n觀察：各組能否準時加入、準時停止，聲響是否配合詩句。\n樂器圖示與分組頁一致；每組使用先前選好的聲響，圖中「／」表示選項。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-ensemble\" class=\"dp-slide dp-cream\" data-slide-id=\"dp-ensemble\" aria-label=\"合奏青蛙打鼓\"><div class=\"dp-copy\"><h2>合奏《青蛙打鼓》</h2><ol class=\"dp-ensemble\"><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g1\">第一組</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">風來了，</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\">人聲／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/maracas.svg\" alt=\"沙槌\"><span>沙槌</span></span></span></li><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g2\">第二組</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">雨來了，</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\"><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/maracas.svg\" alt=\"沙槌\"><span>沙槌</span></span>／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/triangle.svg\" alt=\"三角鐵\"><span>三角鐵</span></span></span></li><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g3\">第三組</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">青蛙背着鼓來了，</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\"><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/guiro.svg\" alt=\"刮瓜\"><span>刮瓜</span></span>／人聲</span></li><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g4\">第四組</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">快快敲，慢慢敲，</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\"><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/drum.svg\" alt=\"小鼓\"><span>小鼓</span></span>／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/hand-drum.svg\" alt=\"手鼓\"><span>手鼓</span></span></span></li><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-g3\">第三組</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">又唱又跳</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\"><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/guiro.svg\" alt=\"刮瓜\"><span>刮瓜</span></span>／人聲</span></li><li class=\"dp-seq\"><span class=\"dp-group-tag dp-gt\">老師/ 其他學生</span><span class=\"dp-ens-text\">把身搖。</span><span class=\"dp-ensemble-instruments\"><span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/triangle.svg\" alt=\"三角鐵\"><span>三角鐵</span></span>／<span class=\"dp-instrument\"><img src=\"./images/xylophone.svg\" alt=\"木琴\"><span>木琴</span></span></span></li></ol><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"highlight-next\">下一句</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "highlight-next",
          "label": "下一句（最後再按重設）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-tidy-up",
      "title": "收拾樂器",
      "notes": "59–62 分鐘。樂器回休息位置，然後回座，雙手放膝上。按步驟收拾。可按「開始 3 分鐘倒數」（再按會重新開始）。\n觀察：各組能否安靜、有秩序地收拾。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-tidy-up\" class=\"dp-slide dp-sunshine\" data-slide-id=\"dp-tidy-up\" aria-label=\"收拾樂器\"><div class=\"dp-copy dp-center\"><h2>收拾樂器</h2><ol class=\"dp-steps\"><li>樂器回休息位置</li><li>回座，雙手放膝上</li></ol><p class=\"dp-timer\" data-seconds=\"180\" aria-live=\"polite\">3:00</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"dp-stage-btn\" data-action=\"start-timer\">開始 3 分鐘倒數</button></div></section>",
      "media": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "start-timer",
          "label": "開始 3 分鐘倒數"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dp-recap",
      "title": "今天學了甚麼？",
      "notes": "62–70 分鐘。請學生說一說今天學了甚麼。\n預期答案：節奏會安排字的長短和停頓；同一句話可以有不同節奏；可以用樂器為詩歌配聲響。\n預告下一課：《小豬過橋》配上動作及聲響。",
      "html": "<section id=\"dp-recap\" class=\"dp-slide dp-poem dp-scene\" data-slide-id=\"dp-recap\" aria-label=\"今天學了甚麼\"><div class=\"dp-art\" data-emoji=\"🐸\"><img src=\"./images/frog-pond-rain.png\" alt=\"青蛙背着小鼓站在荷葉上\"></div><div class=\"dp-copy\"><p class=\"dp-kicker\">今天學了甚麼？</p><h2>節奏會安排字的<br>長短和停頓</h2><p class=\"dp-lead dp-next\">下一課：《小豬過橋》<br>配上動作及聲響</p></div></section>",
      "media": []
    }
  ]
